{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","沙奎尔"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名骁勇善战的战士，变身为狼时拥有强大的作战能力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","新的敌人，新的挑战！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","New foes! New challenges!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","力量是达成梦想的第一步"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Gaining power is the first step in achieving one's dreams!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","我会撕裂你！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","I'll rip you to shreds!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","战斗的荣光……消逝了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","A glorious battle... has waned..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","呵，不堪一击"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","How weak!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","阴影中的利爪，向您问候"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯哼，試試看吧！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","要看我的本事，看够了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","都是蝼蚁，走着瞧吧？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","眼光很锐利，不愧是我承认的对手！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这东西，能让人变强吗？"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","烈战狂狼"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","胜利与荣耀，战士的利爪说了算。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","月夜狂欢"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","狼人并非每个满月都出场，但秋夜节那天另当别论。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有人要打架吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好对手太难找了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","填饱肚子才有力气战斗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","下雪不影响作战！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","最好的礼物就是战斗！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里让我热血沸腾！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","在烟花下尽情战斗！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","沙奎尔有仇必报，连被石头绊倒了，他都要找那块石头对决一次。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","别以为沙奎尔盯着你，轻微地左右歪头是在装可爱——那是因为吻部太长，他正在调整视线，以便一招击穿你的要害。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","沙奎尔时不时会忘记摘下自己的手爪，这让他好几次在系绑腿的带子时受伤。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","虽然在站立时会有点碍事，但在狼形疾速冲刺时则能保持平衡，调整转向，所以沙奎尔很喜欢自己的尾巴。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","无论风霜雨雪，还是飞沙走石，沙奎尔从不打伞，需要庇护之物的人是懦夫！"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","虽然嘴上不说，但沙奎尔承认，泥泞的地面和湿漉漉的雨天是他最大的敌人——或者用常人的形容方式——“最不喜欢的天气”。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","行走和站立时，沙奎尔仍然习惯于微微前倾上身，压低重心，这并非谦恭，而是便于他随时随地猛扑而出。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","沙奎尔的时间观念随事件而变：约他出来对决，他保证按时抵达，如果是中意的对手，他甚至会提前等候——但你想约他谈点生意，恐怕两三天都找不着人。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","沙奎尔认为自己不是穷，也不是节俭，只是在与物欲的战斗中，总能获得胜利。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","别看沙奎尔这样，他其实挺喜欢听吟游诗人的英雄史诗——他总是会全身心代入到主人公身上，并为幻想中的战斗而如醉如痴。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说实话，虽然我将你视为劲敌，但这个称呼并非是蛮血之间劲敌的含义。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411060.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","好好休息，我可以守夜。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411150.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","有人要打架吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415076.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","填饱肚子才有力气战斗"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415077.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","下雪不影响作战！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415385.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","最好的礼物就是战斗！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415386.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","嗬！一位狼兄弟！要不要和我来一场决斗？"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415486.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔 & 法拉莫尔"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","这里让我热血沸腾！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415557.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","在烟花下尽情战斗！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415558.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔"]]}